title: Women's Liberation
new-page: true
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; feminism_timer +=9
is-card: true
card-image: img/kpd_women.jpg
frequency: 100
tags: party_affairs
view-if: feminism_timer <=0

= Women's Liberation

A Marxist party that excludes women is no Marxist party at all. Still, the fact that we, one of the most vocal in our support of women's liberation, struggle to connect with them is problematic . How will we deal with this?

- @leadership: Push for more women in local and national leadership.
- @campaign_women: Include and acknowledge the voices of women within our media and propaganda.
- @message_change: Change our rhetoric to appeal to the new women.
- @bourgeois_feminism: Argue against the currently dominant bourgeois feminism.
- @nothing: We can postpone this matter for later.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@leadership
on-arrival: resources -= 1; women_connection += 1; left_opposition_dissent += 6; right_opposition_dissent += 6; marxist_leninist_dissent += 6; conciliator_dissent += 6; advisor_action_timer -= 1 if zetkin_advisor == 1

We have increased leadership positions for women. Some of them have replaced male leaders, leaving some discontent.

@campaign_women
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; women_connection += 0.5; new_middle_kpd += 1*(1-dissent); workers_kpd += 3*(1-dissent); new_middle_kpd -= 1 if message_change <2; workers_kpd -= 1 if message_change <2; 

We change and create newspapers and posters to address women specifically, while connecting their struggle with the communist cause.  [? if women_connection <2: Our current messaging does not particularly appeal to women, especially those of the working class. ?] [? if message_change >=2: Our attempts at atracting women have finally bore fruit.?]

@message_change
subtitle: This may anger women currently in our own party.
view-if: women_connection > 2
on-arrival: women_connection += 2; left_opposition_dissent += 10; marxist_leninist_dissent += 10; conciliator_dissent += 10; new_middle_kpd += 4*(1-dissent); workers_kpd += 4*(1-dissent);

We try to target the women of the new middle class, also known as "new women" and expands our base. Zetkin and the other women of the party beleive our messaging now to be dangerously close bourgeois feminism. 

@bourgeois_feminism
on-arrival: women_connection += 1; workers_dnvp -= 2; workers_spd -= 2; workers_ddp -=2; socialism += 2*(1-dissent)

We attack bourgeois feminism as serving of the bourgeois while doing nothing to truely liberate working class women. Socialism is the only thing capable of doing so.

@nothing

We have decided to postpone this matter for later, hopefully it doesn't backfire...

- @return: Continue...